    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17158,
        "title": "Aggiornamento delle variabili let",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo già visto che le variabili <code>let</code>, a differenza di <code>const</code>, possono cambiare e aggiornare i valori che memorizzano.</p><p>Usa il segno <code>=</code> per cambiare il valore in <code>playerState</code> da <code>\"Idle\"</code> a <code>\"Running\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiornare le variabili <code>let</code> tutte le volte che vogliamo.</p><p>Prova tu: cambia il valore di <code>playerState</code> in <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jumping&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerState</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"Jumping\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche assegnare alle variabili i valori di altre variabili impostando una variabile uguale all'altra.</p><p>Assegna alla variabile <code>playerState</code> il valore di <code>defaultState</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = defaultState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>defaultState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando aggiorniamo una variabile, dimentica il valore precedente.</p><p>Visualizza la variabile <code>playerState</code> quando è impostata su <code>\"Attacking\"</code> e quando è impostata su <code>\"Defending\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Attacking&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Defending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerState</code>, seguito da <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di queste righe di codice aggiorna la variabile <code>playerHealth</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let playerHealth = 50;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>playerHealth = 50;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145168,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Forest</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelName</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Forest</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145169,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Manca la parola chiave <code>let</code> nella prima riga</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Manca la parola chiave <code>let</code> nella prima riga.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145170,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Lori</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Joe</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Modifica il valore nella variabile <code>playerHealth</code> in <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let playerHealth\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorna la variabile <code>gameState</code> a <code>\"Paused\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let gameState\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>gameState</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>\"Paused\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorna la variabile <code>hudText</code> a <code>\"Start\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Start\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let hudText\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press any key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>hudText</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>\"Start\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cambia il valore della variabile <code>gameState</code> in <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"49\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;GameOver&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameState);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"GameOver\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17159,
        "title": "Espressioni di stringhe",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo concatenare valori stringa con il segno <code>+</code>.</p><p>Somma insieme i valori <code>\"Score:\"</code> e <code>\"55\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamiamo <strong>espressione</strong> l'unione di valori stringa perché crea un singolo valore stringa.</p><p>Aggiungi l'espressione tra le parentesi di <code>console.log()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Score:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>\"55\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando le espressioni contengono variabili, usano i valori presenti nelle variabili.</p><p>Crea un'espressione che sommi il valore <code>\"HP:\"</code> e la variabile <code>playerHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;HP:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerHealth;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"HP:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>console.log()</code> per vedere i risultati delle espressioni.</p><p>Aggiungi un'istruzione <code>console.log()</code> attorno all'espressione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché le espressioni diventano valori, possiamo assegnarle alle variabili proprio come i valori.</p><p>Salva l'espressione <code>\"Level:\" + \"13\"</code> nella variabile <code>label</code> e visualizzala nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Level:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e poi <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore di <code>label</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Player:Rex\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Rex\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Player:Rex\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145181,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Nulla, perché non c'è alcuna istruzione <code>console.log()</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>GameOver</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nulla, perché non c'è alcuna istruzione <code>console.log()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145182,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + enemyName);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy:slime</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>slime</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Enemy:slime</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>GameStart</code> senza uno spazio nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Perché <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> somma i valori senza uno spazio</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Perché <code>console.log()</code> non visualizza mai gli spazi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché <code>\"Game\" + \"Start\"</code> somma i valori senza uno spazio.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi la variabile <code>score</code> all'espressione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"&quot;14&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Score:55</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Score:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console.log</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>\"Score:\" + \"55\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145186,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza <code>Level 3</code> nella console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label + number);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>label</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145187,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica il valore stringa <code>\"coins\"</code> per vedere quante monete abbiamo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinCount = \" /><text value=\"&quot;40 &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coinCount + \" /><text value=\"&quot;coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
